{{Velious Era}}

In the first gorge marked by [[Veeshan]], the '''Dragon Necropolis''' was made for the dragons to bury their dead. The necropolis is sacred and living wurms are not permitted to enter. This crypt holds undead dragons, warzone for rats, and home to the exiled '''[[Zlandicar]]''' due to his exile for his cannibalistic tendencies. There are two ratmen factions at war in the necropolis known as the [[Paebala]] ("good") & the [[Chetari]] ("evil").

